            {
              "type": "thinking",
              "thinking": "To find the number of trailing zeros in 125!, I need to find the number of times 10 divides 125!, which equals the number of times 5 divides 125! (since there are always more factors of 2 than 5).\n\nUsing Legendre's formula:\n⌊125/5⌋ = 25\n⌊125/25⌋ = 5\n⌊125/125⌋ = 1\n⌊125/625⌋ = 0\n\nTotal = 25 + 5 + 1 = 31",
